Expense Policy

Employees can claim reimbursement for business travel, client meals, and approved software subscriptions. All claims must be submitted within 30 days of the expense date, with a receipt attached.

Meals during business travel are reimbursed up to 1,500 rupees per day. Client meals must list the names of all attendees. Alcohol is not reimbursable.

Flights must be booked in economy class through the company travel portal. Claims above 25,000 rupees need written approval from a department head before booking. Reimbursements are paid within 10 working days of approval.
